Động lượng của vật $\mathit{p}\mathbf{=}\mathit{mv}\mathbf{\Rightarrow}\left\{ \begin{array}{r}
\mathit{p}_{1} \\
\mathbf{=}\mathit{m}_{1} \\
\mathit{v}_{1}
\end{array} \right\}\mathit{p}_{2}\mathbf{=}\mathit{m}_{2}\mathit{v}_{2}\mathbf{\Rightarrow}\frac{\mathit{p}_{1}}{\mathit{p}_{2}}\mathbf{=}\frac{\mathit{m}_{1}}{\mathit{v}}_{1}\mathit{m}_{2}\mathit{v}_{2}\mathbf{=}\frac{2\mathit{m}_{2}}{.}\frac{\mathit{v}_{2}}{2}\mathit{m}_{2}\mathit{v}_{2}\mathbf{=}1$
